:: f3 [f3 raven-wing map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box' style='height: min-content;'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around->f3: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Nothing else yet->blah]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'f3'>><<e>><<s>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'f3'>>
</div>

:: f3: description [f3 raven-wing description]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <img class='concept' src='images/story/raven-wing.png'>
  <div>
    <p>Raven Wing is located high in the mountains. It snows here year round!</p>
    <p>It is the home of the Forge Workshop and their leader Matiu. People say he's quite intense and doesn't like to be interrupted when he's working.</p>
    <p>Crossing all the way to the east side of town might be difficult, given all the snow.</p>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Check out Raven Wing.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>